        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold leading-tight text-gray-900 md:text-5xl">
            Big Data: Turn Large Amounts of Data into Intelligent Decisions
        </h1>

        <p class="text-lg leading-8 text-gray-500">
            Discover how Big Data helps businesses transform massive volumes of
            information into actionable insights, improve operational
            efficiency, identify emerging opportunities, and make smarter
            decisions through advanced analytics and modern data technologies.
        </p>
